        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLG150SMTS4, 1-1/2\" Delong Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1-1/2 inch diameter door pull from First Impressions is made with a stainless steel grip and brass mounts. The 1-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Delong Pull can be used on glass, fiberglass, metal, or wood doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, back-to-back mounting, and surface mounting. It is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Model Delong Series 2 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLG02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262300\"><b>First Impressions DLG150 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DLG150018SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLG150024SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLG150036SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance:1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
